1 NAME Ukjent Torstein
2 GIVN Ukjent Torstein
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} N.B. Should not be confused with "Rike-Torstein".
2 CONT
2 CONT Torstein is only known from the ''Smør-tavla'' from cirka 1547, made as a copy from the trial between Erik Ormson and Trond Benkestok. This table shows how Erik Ormsons wife and Trond Benkestok was related to Jon Smør. Torstein is
2 CONC  in the table as the husband of Kristina Andersdatter, and father of the wife of Erik Ormson, Kristina Torsteinsdatter. Beyond this information, it is not known who Torstein was.
2 CONT
2 CONT See ''Benkestok-seminaret'' page 22ff og ''Vår felles Slektshistorie'' chapter 4.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
