2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Thoron is suppose to bee daughter of King Haakon lV ( the old) Haakonson. Mother was Margrete Arry. Thoron married Thorald Gunnarson Hvit. She is also listed as sister to, Princess Kristina Haakonsdaughter of Tonsberg (Tønsberg, V
2 CONC estfold), Kristina is also, Princess Consort of Seville, Castella, Spain. She was married to, Don Philippe Fernandez. Might bee a member of the Spanisch Royal family? There is a statue of Princess Kristina, at the foothills of cas
2 CONC tle Mountains in Tonsberg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wonder if Thoron Cecilie is the right name? Thoron is a name I have not seen. nor heard of. But, I have seen some use Torun, witch are and old name in Norway. There is one Cecilie Haakonsdaughter, mentioned as daughter of King Haa
2 CONC kon and Margrete.
2 CONT --------------------
