2 CONT Ingeborg Taraldsdtr Eikeland could also have 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died in Vaskeland Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Taraldsdtr Eikeland was born before 1446 at Eikeland øvre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Svein Nilsen Eikeland, son of Nils (--?--) Eikeland. She died at Valle, Vest Agder, Norway. She is mentioned Kvinesdal.
2 CONC I.393.Lund 259.
2 CONT
2 CONT Svein Nilsen Eikeland married Ingeborg Taraldsdtr Eikeland, daughter of Taralde Bergulfsen Eikeland. He was born before 1491 at Eikeland øvre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Kvinesdal.I.393.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>Lund, Skår 259.VII, Ætt&Heim 1956 s.108/109.</p><p>Datter av Torgalde Bergulfson Øvre Eikeland, Kvinesdal. Gift med Svein Nilsson Øvre Eikeland. Fikk separasjon i 1491 og flyttet til søsteren etter å ha gitt fra seg sin eiendom
2 CONC  i Aske til henne,  mot å få sitt livs opphold der.</p>
