1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Thoralde Reidulfssøn (15th century)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography''':
2 CONT * '''1436''': Thoralde Reidulfssøn in Eker confirmed to Olaf Saulessøn his previous sale of a part of his farm Søndre Viken to Olaf's father (Saule at Berg).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family and Children''':
2 CONT He was married to '''Mildrid Halvardsdtr'''. The text records the following sons:
2 CONT # Haldor Thoraldessøn — bailiff (lensmand) at Eker in 1437.
2 CONT # Halvard Thoraldessøn — sold a part of Søndre Øxne in Lier in 1394, mentioned in 1423 as owner of Østre Aas.
2 CONT # Aslak Thoraldessøn — mentioned together with his brother Halvard in 1394 and 1423. Married to Ragnhild Gulbrandsdtr.
2 CONT # Reidulf Thoraldessøn — known only insofar as he must be the father of Haldor Reidulfssøn.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # Norsk tidsskrift for genealogi, personalhistorie, biografi og literærhistorie (1908), Vol. 1, No. 3, [https://www.nb.no/items/e10dd023f88a4b86e782b2a2173a9e52?page=5&sea...øn= p. 164]
2 CONT # Archival references from the text: DN. VIII 296, DN. IV 631, DN. III 669.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Bekræfter i 1436 ovenfor Olaf Saulessøn sit tidligere salg av en del av sin gård Søndre Viken til Olafs far.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Thoralde Reidulfssøn gm Mildrid Halvardsdtr. Bekræfter i 1436 ovenfor Olaf Saulessøn sit tidligere salg av en del av sin gård Søndre Viken til Olafs far.
