2 CONT
2 CONT Skiftebrev av 1578 Bergen-Bymuseum.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Enno Christophersen BRANDRØK 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Else Christophersdtr TRONDS 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Anna Christophersdtr TRONDS 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Magdalene Christophersdtr TRONDS 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Margrethe Christophersdtr. TRONDS 
