1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jørgen Holgersen Rosenkrantz, til Kjeldgaard=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz and Sophie Axelsdatter Brahe
2 CONT * Jørgen Rosenkrantz , born 11 June 1607 , died 8 January 1675 , was a Danish nobleman , son of Holger Rosenkrantz ("the learned"), brother of Gunde and Erik Rosenkrantz . 
2 CONT * Jörgen R ., the brother of the preceding, b. 1607, d. 1675, rent master in 1648 and "hofmester" at Sorö Academy in 1653; he possessed such great theological learning that upon Archbishop Svanes's death in 1668, he was questioned
2 CONC  as his successor.
2 CONT *  In this marriage Jorgen Rosenkrantz  & Christence Juel gave birth to 10 children. They had five sons and five daughters; the son Erik had seven sons and seven daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Christence Jensdatter Juel''' on 12-08-1637 at Kjeldgaard, Selde Denmark
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gynter Göransson Rosenschantz/ Rosenkrantz; 
2 CONT * '''Ide Margrethe Jørgensdatter Rosenkrantz (1639-66).''' Page 76 - Denmark first in Our Love. Mr. Father's hall. and high-law memory, and then in Our own daily Court service and attendance have stayed.« Liitzow was married on Ju
2 CONC ne 22, 1656 to Maid Ide Rosenkrantz, daughter of Gunde Rosenkrantz's brother Jørgen. Johan Lauremberg wrote a Latin poem to the bride's family, which was tr3kt. Ide Rosenkrantz died in 1666. In 1672 Liitzow married Karen Jewel, Wi
2 CONC dow of Marcus Rodsten to Lundsgaard, Daughter of Ove Jewel to Bruusgaard (of the Liljejuelernes family) The Liitzow family is still alive.
2 CONT * '''Jens Jørgensen Rosenkrantz, af Rosenholm''' (1640-95);
2 CONT * '''Sophie Jørgensdatter Rosenkrantz''' (1642-79);
2 CONT * '''Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz''' (1645-1704);
2 CONT * '''Dorthe Jørgensdatter Rosenkrantz;'''
2 CONT *  '''Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz, til Brusgård i Ølst'''; 
2 CONT * '''Beate Jørgensdatter Rosenkrantz;''' 
2 CONT * '''Ove Jørgensen Rosenkrantz;'''
2 CONT *  '''Otte Jørgensen Rosenkrantz;'''
2 CONT *  '''Frederik Jørgensen Rosenkrantz'''
2 CONT
