2 CONT translation: Peter Nikulasson, mentioned from 1363 to 1405, treasurer in Tunsberg, married to his cousin Elin Ranesdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Kirkeby, Birger. Builder's book for Sauherad, gards and ottog . (Sauherad: Utgjevar Sauherad municipality, 1980-1988), 4: 517, Eight from Søum and Reine in Sandsvær. 'Elin Ranesdotter [child of Rane Eivindsson and Åsa Salmundsd.
2 CONC ], Gm siblings child Peter Nikulasson, fehirde in Tunsberg, Governor of Vestfold, page in Sud-Hålogaland, mentioned 1363 to 1405' 
2 CONT
2 CONT translation: Elin Ranesdatter [child of Rane Eivindsson and Åsa Salmundsd .], married to her cousin Peter Nikulasson, treasurer in Tunsberg, provincial judge in Vestfold, later in Sud-Hålogaland, mentioned 1363 to 1405.
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ 3.0  3.1 Along Lågen A / S, and Kværnar Forlag. Along Lågen: local historical reading book for the villages and towns along the Numedalslågen . (Kongsberg: Kværnar Forlag), no. 3:89, p. 140. ↑ Birth year estimated based on the y
2 CONC ears he is mentioned, and the estimated birth years of his siblings.
