1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from:  Odda, Ullensvang og Kinsarvik i gamal og ny tid, (by Olav Kolltveit) volume 3/2 Odda (p. 115) - Bruk 1 Vasstun.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore was brother of Lars Salamonson Y. Jaastad br. 1 (In Y. Jastad Lars Salamonson is called Kraakevik -- But Salomon in Kraakevik is Not listed with sons Tore & Lars, just Johannes...)  Both Tore & Lars were probably of the Hovla
2 CONC nd family since they owned a part in Hovland that they sold to Ivar Hovland in 1670.  Tore also bought what the Hovland people owned in Vasstun.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore sold building material and timber; and was fined mildly (3 rdl.) because of his weak children ("for sine svage borns skyld") & he promised to stop.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore & ?Kari? Ellingsdatter had 5 children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a.  Salamon m. 1673 Barbro Paalsdatter, lived on Bakke br. 1 - had 5 children, but whole family must have died before 1695, because not mentioned in Jens' skifte.
2 CONT
2 CONT b.  Hallvard, lived on Hjollo, bruk 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT c.  Elling Vasstun (see profile)
2 CONT
2 CONT d.  Jens Vasstun (died 1695 - skifte 28 February 1695) - took over farm in 1686, together with Elling.  Jens married 1692 Maren Danielsdatter - no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT e.  Marta (1664-1741) m. 1684 Ola Nilsson Eide br. 1.
