1 NAME Strange Jørgensen /Jørgensen/
2 GIVN Strange Jørgensen
2 _MARNM Jørgensen
1 NAME Strange Jørgensen /Jørgensen/
2 GIVN Strange Jørgensen
2 SURN Jørgensen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 APR 1539
2 ADDR
