2 CONT ==[https://www.academia.edu/15062386/Svinhufvud_%C3%A4tternas_gemensamma_ursprung?email_work_card=thumbnail The Common Origin of the Svinhufvud Families, By Anders Winroth]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svinhufvud_i_V%C3%A4sterg%C3%B6tland_nr_199#TAB_4 Daniel Torkelsson Svinhufvud till Främby, by Adelsvapen Geneology]
