1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Haldor Reidulfssøn (15th century – c. 1508)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography''':
2 CONT * '''Origin''': Son of Reidulf Thoraldessøn.
2 CONT * '''Status''': Large-scale landowner and owner of the entire Hoen estate (both Nordre and Søndre Hoen) in Eker.
2 CONT * '''1482''': Bought the Røyseng farm in Ringerike from Roald Sigurdssøn (DN. V 917).
2 CONT * '''1486''': Announced the sale of a mill waterfall (kvernfos) in Holmefos [Fossesholm] in Eker (DN. II 934).
2 CONT * '''1493''': Bought abandoned farms on both sides of the Eker strand and the Fagerholt farm in Haug parish from Mrs. Margrete Johansdatter (DN. II 974).
2 CONT '''Death''': He is last mentioned in sources in '''1508''' (DN. II 1028). After his death, the estate was divided among his sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children (who fixed the farm boundaries in 1523 according to DN. VIII 513)''':
2 CONT # Olaf — received Nordre Hoen and Ulleland.
2 CONT # Nils — co-owner of Søndre Hoen.
2 CONT # Reidulf — co-owner of Søndre Hoen.
2 CONT # Asbjørn — co-owner of Søndre Hoen.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # Diplomatarium Norvegicum (DN): II 934, II 974, II 1028, V 917, VIII 513.
2 CONT # Norsk tidsskrift for genealogi (1908), Vol. 1, No. 3, pp. [https://www.nb.no/items/e10dd023f88a4b86e782b2a2173a9e52?page=5&sea...øn= 164-165].
2 CONT
2 CONT ——————
2 CONT Haldor Reidulfssøn  Kjøper 1465 av Margrete Johansdtr. hendes Ødegårder på 2 sider av Ekerstranden, Ødegaarden Fagerholt i Haug sogn. I 1482 kjøper han gården Røyseng på Ringerike. I 1486 selger han Kvernfos i Holmefos [Fossesholm
2 CONC ] på Eker. Nevnt 1508. Eier S.- og N. Hoen.
