2 CONC St Olav's church, Nidaros by charter dated 29 Sep 1225 which names "Margrettar dottor"[256].  m (25 May 1225) HAAKON Haakonsson King of Norway, illegitimate son of HAAKON Sverkersson King of the Birkebeiner & his mistress Inge ---
